      "revision": 1325391248,
      "text": "Elaeocarpus hygrophilus is a species of plant in the Elaeocarpaceae family. It is distributed in Southeast Asia. The tree is 10–25 metres (33–82 ft) tall. The fruits are olive-like."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Elaeocarpus hygrophilus",
